{"unit":{"id":"l1-u20","level":1,"order":20,"title":"Here & There","wordIds":["w:这里","w:那里","w:哪里","w:地方","w:地点","w:这儿","w:那儿","w:哪儿","w:这边","w:那边","w:里边","w:外边"],"grammarIds":["g:nali-where","g:zher-nar-colloquial","g:erhua-suffix"],"sentenceIds":["s:l1:116","s:l1:117","s:l1:165","s:l1:166","s:l1:167","s:l1:199","s:l1:179","s:l1:180","s:l1:186"]},"grammar":[{"id":"g:nali-where","title":"哪里/那里 for location","pattern":"在 + 哪里/那里","explanation":"哪里 (nǎlǐ) asks \"where\", and 那里 (nàlǐ) answers \"there\". Both pair naturally with 在: 你在哪里? (\"Where are you?\") and 他在那里 (\"He's over there\").","level":1,"sentenceIds":["s:l1:116","s:l1:117","s:l1:118","s:l1:119"],"unitId":"l1-u20"},{"id":"g:zher-nar-colloquial","title":"这儿/哪儿 as spoken alternatives","pattern":"这儿 / 哪儿","explanation":"这儿 (zhèr) and 哪儿 (nǎr) are casual, conversational equivalents of 这里 (\"here\") and 哪里 (\"where\"). They're used exactly the same way, most often right after 在.","level":1,"sentenceIds":["s:l1:165","s:l1:166","s:l1:167","s:l1:168"],"unitId":"l1-u20"},{"id":"g:erhua-suffix","title":"儿 as a colloquial suffix (erhua)","pattern":"word + 儿","explanation":"Adding 儿 (r) to certain words gives them a casual, spoken flavor typical of northern Mandarin: 那 → 那儿 (\"there\"), 玩 → 玩儿 (\"to play\"), 女孩 → 女孩儿 (\"girl\"). It's written as its own character but pronounced fused onto the syllable before it, and doesn't change the core meaning.","level":1,"sentenceIds":["s:l1:195","s:l1:196","s:l1:197","s:l1:198","s:l1:199"],"unitId":"l1-u20"}],"sentences":[{"id":"s:l1:116","zh":"你在哪里？","pinyin":"Nǐ zài nǎlǐ?","en":"Where are you?","wordIds":["w:你","w:在","w:哪里"],"unitId":"l1-u20"},{"id":"s:l1:117","zh":"他在那里。","pinyin":"Tā zài nàlǐ.","en":"He's over there.","wordIds":["w:他","w:在","w:那里"],"unitId":"l1-u20"},{"id":"s:l1:165","zh":"你在哪儿？","pinyin":"Nǐ zài nǎr?","en":"Where are you?","wordIds":["w:你","w:在","w:哪儿"],"unitId":"l1-u20"},{"id":"s:l1:166","zh":"我在这儿。","pinyin":"Wǒ zài zhèr.","en":"I'm here.","wordIds":["w:我","w:在","w:这儿"],"unitId":"l1-u20"},{"id":"s:l1:167","zh":"他不在这儿。","pinyin":"Tā bú zài zhèr.","en":"He's not here.","wordIds":["w:他","w:不","w:在","w:这儿"],"unitId":"l1-u20"},{"id":"s:l1:199","zh":"你去哪儿？","pinyin":"Nǐ qù nǎr?","en":"Where are you going?","wordIds":["w:你","w:去","w:哪儿"],"unitId":"l1-u20"},{"id":"s:l1:179","zh":"你在里边。","pinyin":"Nǐ zài lǐbian.","en":"You're inside.","wordIds":["w:你","w:在","w:里边"],"unitId":"l1-u20"},{"id":"s:l1:180","zh":"商店里边有水果。","pinyin":"Shāngdiàn lǐbian yǒu shuǐguǒ.","en":"There's fruit inside the store.","wordIds":["w:商店","w:里边","w:有","w:水果"],"unitId":"l1-u20"},{"id":"s:l1:186","zh":"请问，商店在哪里？","pinyin":"Qǐngwèn, shāngdiàn zài nǎlǐ?","en":"Excuse me, where's the store?","wordIds":["w:请问","w:商店","w:在","w:哪里"],"unitId":"l1-u20"}]}
